```js
await act(async () => {
      submitFormTwiceButtonRef.current.click();
      await waitFor(['Render']);
      submitFormTwiceButtonRef.current.click();
});
```

And a `Scheduler.log('Render');` in render.

This will test closer to what a real user interaction would be like.

